QUERY PLAN:text
GroupAggregate
  Group Key: x, y, z, w
  ->  Incremental Sort
        Sort Key: x, y, z, w
        Presorted Key: x, y
        ->  Index Scan using a10_btg_x_y_idx on a10_btg
