>   GROUP BY t1.w, t1.z, t1.x
QUERY PLAN:text
GroupAggregate
  Group Key: t1.x, t1.w, t1.z
  ->  Merge Join
        Merge Cond: ((t1.x = t2.x) AND (t1.w = t2.w) AND (t1.z = t2.z))
        ->  Incremental Sort
              Sort Key: t1.x, t1.w, t1.z
              Presorted Key: t1.x
              ->  Index Scan using a10_btg_x_y_idx on a10_btg t1
        ->  Sort
              Sort Key: t2.x, t2.w, t2.z
              ->  Index Scan using a10_btg_x_y_idx on a10_btg t2
-- EXPLAIN

