> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select 1 - id as c from
> (select id from a10_mt3 t1 union all select id * 2 from a10_mt3 t2) ss
> order by c
QUERY PLAN:text
Result
  Output: ((1 - t1.id))
  ->  Merge Append
        Sort Key: ((1 - t1.id))
        ->  Index Scan using a10_mt3i on public.a10_mt3 t1
              Output: t1.id, (1 - t1.id)
        ->  Sort
              Output: ((t2.id * 2)), ((1 - (t2.id * 2)))
              Sort Key: ((1 - (t2.id * 2)))
              ->  Seq Scan on public.a10_mt3 t2
                    Output: (t2.id * 2), (1 - (t2.id * 2))
-- EXPLAIN

> explain (costs off)
> select 1 - id as c from
> (select id from a10_mt3 t1 union all select id * 2 from a10_mt3 t2) ss
> order by c
